      'You are not obliged to accept a quote. If you do not want to go ahead after a pro has looked at the job, tell them and tell us. We do not charge you for that.',
    ],
  },
  {
    id: 'payment',
    title: 'Payment',
    body: [
      '<strong class="text-ink">Booking is free. AZAP does not collect payment for jobs, does not hold money on your behalf, and does not add any fee, commission or surcharge to your price.</strong>',
