    ],
  },
  {
    id: 'damage',
    title: 'Damage, loss and insurance',
    body: [
      '<strong class="text-ink">AZAP does not insure the work, your property, or your possessions.</strong> Pros are independent and may or may not carry their own insurance. We do not verify insurance and you should ask your pro directly if this matters to you.',
      'If a pro damages something, that is in the first instance a matter between you and them, as it would be with any independent tradesperson. Tell us and we will help: we know who we sent, we have the record, and we can withdraw work from them.',
      'For high-value property or work with a significant risk of damage, consider checking your own insurance position before the work starts.',
    ],
  },
  {
    id: 'complaints',
    title: 'Complaints and disputes',
    body: [
      'Raise a complaint with us at <a href="mailto:disputes@getazap.com" class="font-bold text-accent-ink hover:underline">disputes@getazap.com</a>, or anything about money at <a href="mailto:refunds@getazap.com" class="font-bold text-accent-ink hover:underline">refunds@getazap.com</a>. Tell us the booking reference if you have it.',
      'We aim to acknowledge complaints within two working days and to tell you what we have been able to establish within ten. Where a dispute is between you and your pro, our role is to provide the record, put the question to them, and tell you honestly what they say.',
