    body: [
      'Nothing in these terms creates an employment relationship, partnership, joint venture or agency between AZAP and any pro, or between you and AZAP.',
      'Pros are independent. They choose which jobs to accept, set their own prices, use their own tools, decide how to carry out the work, and are free to work for anyone else, including directly for you.',
