      'Complaints and disputes: <a href="mailto:disputes@getazap.com" class="font-bold text-accent-ink hover:underline">disputes@getazap.com</a>',
      'Money and refunds: <a href="mailto:refunds@getazap.com" class="font-bold text-accent-ink hover:underline">refunds@getazap.com</a>',
      'Anything about these terms: <a href="mailto:admin@getazap.com" class="font-bold text-accent-ink hover:underline">admin@getazap.com</a>',
      'You can also reach us through our <a href="/contact" class="font-bold text-accent-ink hover:underline">contact page</a>.',
